    {
     "id": "pr-sf0174",
     "type": "text",
     "x": 40,
     "y": 452,
     "w": 580,
     "h": 248,
     "valign": "top",
     "fill": null,
     "lineColor": null,
     "paras": [
      {
       "align": "left",
       "bullet": {
        "type": "char",
        "level": 0,
        "code": "2022"
       },
       "spaceAfter": 4,
       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "調欄寬列高",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "：選取表格後，上緣與左緣會出現藍色把手，拖曳就能調。要加欄或加列，用右側面板的「新增」。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "align": "left",
       "bullet": {
        "type": "char",
        "level": 0,
        "code": "2022"
       },
       "spaceAfter": 4,
       "runs": [
        {
         "text": "刪掉整欄或整列",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A",
         "bold": true
        },
        {
         "text": "：把手之間的灰色區段，滑過會變紅，點一下就刪掉。合併過的儲存格會自動縮減，其他欄寬列高不受影響。",
         "sizePt": 10,
         "color": "1A1A1A"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
